{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjPWW1t3mCcnQCp6G9vK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BebXgsUWgD5Z4n649PLUJJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"sed -n 3541,3546p API.md; sed -n 3844,3853p API.md; n=$(grep -n \"^### interface FootGoal\" API.md | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"$n,$((n+22))p\" API.md | cut -c1-200; sed -n 2909,2916p API.md; grep -n \"interface SheetOptions\" -A14 API.md | cut -c1-150 | head -20; grep -n \"interface ParticlePreset\" -A18 API.md | cut -c1-130; sed -n 3437,3445p API.md","description":"Read clip analysis and particle signatures"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19862,"cache_read_input_tokens":190157,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":19862},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c1a9a6e-6f1f-4c91-a925-8ef76c3e492e","uuid":"79b8efd1-a0e9-455b-b3f6-9e6c85b276f5","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:30:19.117Z","request_id":"req_011CgjPWVi2YHrK5rQtMYFN5","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01BebXgsUWgD5Z4n649PLUJJ":{"command":"sed -n 3541,3546p API.md; sed -n 3844,3853p API.md; n=$(grep -n \"^### interface FootGoal\" API.md | cut -d: -f1); sed -n \"$n,$((n+22))p\" API.md | cut -c1-200; sed -n 2909,2916p API.md; grep -n \"interface SheetOptions\" -A14 API.md | cut -c1-150 | head -20; grep -n \"interface ParticlePreset\" -A18 API.md | cut -c1-130; sed -n 3437,3445p API.md","description":"Read clip analysis and particle signatures"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BebXgsUWgD5Z4n649PLUJJ","type":"tool_result","content":"### analyzeClip()\n\n```ts\nfunction analyzeClip(model: Object3D, rig: RigSpec, def: ClipDef, clip: AnimationClip): ClipReport\n```\n\n### validateClip()\n\n```ts\nfunction validateClip(clip: ClipDef, rig: RigSpec): string[]\n```\n\nProblems with a clip definition itself (unknown joints, bad key order, loop mismatch).\n\n## 13. Hero kit\n\n### interface FootGoal\n\nFoot-placement IK: say where a foot should be, get the hip/knee/ankle rotations.\n\nAuthors write the body (pelvis height, lean, arms...) and then pin the feet:\n\n  placeFeet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.2, 0] }, Torso: [20, 0, 0] }, rig, {\n    R: { z: 0.15 },                             // right foot flat, 15 cm ahead\n    L: { z: -0.2, pitch: 30, pivot: 'ball' },   // left heel raised on its toes\n  })\n\nCoordinates are the character's ground frame: y up from the floor, z forward. The solve\nis planar (legs bend about X, knees forward); lateral offsets are ignored. It accounts\nfor the root's position, rotation and squash, so a squashed or leaning body still\nkeeps its feet exactly where they were asked…\n\n- `z: number`: Forward position of the ankle (m) when the foot is flat.\n- `x?: number`: Sideways position (m, + = the character's left). Default: under the hip at rest. Only matters when the root is turned (e.g. a pivot on one foot); the solve itself stays in the leg's pl\n- `y?: number`: Height of the sole above the floor (m). 0 = standing on it.\n- `pitch?: number`: Sole pitch in degrees: + = toes down / heel raised, − = toes up.\n- `pivot?: 'heel' | 'ball' | 'ankle'`: Point that stays at (z, y) while pitching: heel (heel strike), toe tip (tiptoe, toe-off) or ankle.\n- `follow?: number`: 0..1: let the foot hang from the shin instead of holding its world pitch (swinging feet, dangling in the air). 1 = foot at `relax` degrees relative to the shin.\n- `relax?: number`: Foot angle relative to the shin when following (default 15 = toes slightly down).\n### checkModel()\n\n```ts\nfunction checkModel(idOrDef: string | ModelDef, opts: CheckOptions = {}): ModelCheck\n```\n\nEvery check over the model's range: the defaults, then each param at its min and at its max\n(one at a time), each at seeds 1, 2 and 3 when the parts read the rng. Messages say which\n2703:### interface ParticlePreset\n2704-\n2705-A particle effect as data. Sizes are in art pixels (whole pixels, so particles stay crisp\n2706-squares), colors are palette names stepped over each particle's life (no blending).\n2707-\n2708-- `count: Range`: Particles per burst.\n2709-- `life: Range`: Seconds each particle lives.\n2710-- `speed: Range`: Launch speed, world units / s.\n2711-- `direction?: Vec3`: Main launch direction (default straight up).\n2712-- `spread?: number`: Cone half-angle around `direction`, degrees (180 = every direction). Default 180.\n2713-- `flatten?: number`: Multiply vertical launch speed (0.2 = dust that hugs the ground). Default 1.\n2714-- `gravity?: number`: Downward acceleration, world units / s² (negative floats up). Default 0.\n2715-- `drag?: number`: Velocity damping per second (0 = none).\n2716-- `size: readonly [number, number]`: Size in art pixels at birth and at death (rounded to whole pixels).\n2717-- `colors: readonly PaletteColor[]`: Palette colors stepped through over the lifetime.\n2718-- `radius?: number`: Random spawn offset radius, world units.\n2719-- `max?: number`: Pool size (max alive at once). Default 256.\n2720-\n2721-### type ParticlePresetName\n### textureDef()\n\n```ts\nfunction textureDef(def: T): T\n```\n\nReturns the def as written, typed, so tuples and literals don't widen (as `model` does). Not\n`texture`: TSL's `texture()` samples a map, and games import both.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c1a9a6e-6f1f-4c91-a925-8ef76c3e492e","uuid":"12158af7-e800-4b8f-bb6e-261166564606","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:30:19.219Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"### analyzeClip()\n\n```ts\nfunction analyzeClip(model: Object3D, rig: RigSpec, def: ClipDef, clip: AnimationClip): ClipReport\n```\n\n### validateClip()\n\n```ts\nfunction validateClip(clip: ClipDef, rig: RigSpec): string[]\n```\n\nProblems with a clip definition itself (unknown joints, bad key order, loop mismatch).\n\n## 13. Hero kit\n\n### interface FootGoal\n\nFoot-placement IK: say where a foot should be, get the hip/knee/ankle rotations.\n\nAuthors write the body (pelvis height, lean, arms...) and then pin the feet:\n\n  placeFeet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.2, 0] }, Torso: [20, 0, 0] }, rig, {\n    R: { z: 0.15 },                             // right foot flat, 15 cm ahead\n    L: { z: -0.2, pitch: 30, pivot: 'ball' },   // left heel raised on its toes\n  })\n\nCoordinates are the character's ground frame: y up from the floor, z forward. The solve\nis planar (legs bend about X, knees forward); lateral offsets are ignored. It accounts\nfor the root's position, rotation and squash, so a squashed or leaning body still\nkeeps its feet exactly where they were asked…\n\n- `z: number`: Forward position of the ankle (m) when the foot is flat.\n- `x?: number`: Sideways position (m, + = the character's left). Default: under the hip at rest. Only matters when the root is turned (e.g. a pivot on one foot); the solve itself stays in the leg's pl\n- `y?: number`: Height of the sole above the floor (m). 0 = standing on it.\n- `pitch?: number`: Sole pitch in degrees: + = toes down / heel raised, − = toes up.\n- `pivot?: 'heel' | 'ball' | 'ankle'`: Point that stays at (z, y) while pitching: heel (heel strike), toe tip (tiptoe, toe-off) or ankle.\n- `follow?: number`: 0..1: let the foot hang from the shin instead of holding its world pitch (swinging feet, dangling in the air). 1 = foot at `relax` degrees relative to the shin.\n- `relax?: number`: Foot angle relative to the shin when following (default 15 = toes slightly down).\n### checkModel()\n\n```ts\nfunction checkModel(idOrDef: string | ModelDef, opts: CheckOptions = {}): ModelCheck\n```\n\nEvery check over the model's range: the defaults, then each param at its min and at its max\n(one at a time), each at seeds 1, 2 and 3 when the parts read the rng. Messages say which\n2703:### interface ParticlePreset\n2704-\n2705-A particle effect as data. Sizes are in art pixels (whole pixels, so particles stay crisp\n2706-squares), colors are palette names stepped over each particle's life (no blending).\n2707-\n2708-- `count: Range`: Particles per burst.\n2709-- `life: Range`: Seconds each particle lives.\n2710-- `speed: Range`: Launch speed, world units / s.\n2711-- `direction?: Vec3`: Main launch direction (default straight up).\n2712-- `spread?: number`: Cone half-angle around `direction`, degrees (180 = every direction). Default 180.\n2713-- `flatten?: number`: Multiply vertical launch speed (0.2 = dust that hugs the ground). Default 1.\n2714-- `gravity?: number`: Downward acceleration, world units / s² (negative floats up). Default 0.\n2715-- `drag?: number`: Velocity damping per second (0 = none).\n2716-- `size: readonly [number, number]`: Size in art pixels at birth and at death (rounded to whole pixels).\n2717-- `colors: readonly PaletteColor[]`: Palette colors stepped through over the lifetime.\n2718-- `radius?: number`: Random spawn offset radius, world units.\n2719-- `max?: number`: Pool size (max alive at once). Default 256.\n2720-\n2721-### type ParticlePresetName\n### textureDef()\n\n```ts\nfunction textureDef(def: T): T\n```\n\nReturns the def as written, typed, so tuples and literals don't widen (as `model` does). Not\n`texture`: TSL's `texture()` samples a map, and games import both.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BebXgsUWgD5Z4n649PLUJJ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjPXtWG5zoUrctoUdnxP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TZSfCyKR5p1U5HJGc7Phgj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > src/art/clips.js <<'E'\n// Every clip the game authored. ClipDef data on the kit's HERO_RIG.\nimport { gaitClip, HERO_CLIPS, HERO_RIG, mirror, placeFeet } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\n\nconst hold = (name, pose) => ({ name, frames: 60, loop: true, keys: [[0, pose], [60, pose]] });\nconst feet = (pose, R, L) => placeFeet(pose, HERO_RIG, { R, L });\nconst flat = { z: 0 };\nconst standBase = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.02, 0] }, ArmR: [6, 0, -9], ArmL: [6, 0, 9] };\nconst stand = feet(standBase, flat, flat);\n\n// Poses for Holding Still.\nconst POSES = [\n  hold('Tree', { Pelvis: { p: [0.03, -0.02, 0] }, ArmR: [-172, 0, -6], ForearmR: [-14, 0, 0], ArmL: [-172, 0, 6], ForearmL: [-14, 0, 0], LegR: [-62, 0, -58], ShinR: [150, 0, 0], FootR: [30, 0, 0] }),\n  hold('Heron', { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.02, 0] }, Torso: [10, 0, 0], Head: [-14, 0, 0], ArmR: [-20, 0, -80], ArmL: [-20, 0, 80], ForearmR: [-30, 0, 0], ForearmL: [-30, 0, 0], LegR: [-85, 0, 0], ShinR: [95, 0, 0], FootR: [35, 0, 0] }),\n  hold('Warrior', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.2, 0] }, Torso: [0, 25, 0], Head: [0, 40, 0], ArmR: [0, 0, -90], ArmL: [0, 0, 90] }, { z: 0.38 }, { z: -0.38 })),\n  hold('Chair', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.28, -0.06] }, Torso: [24, 0, 0], Head: [-18, 0, 0], ArmR: [-110, 0, -8], ArmL: [-110, 0, 8] }, flat, flat)),\n  hold('Fold', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.03, -0.03] }, Torso: [88, 0, 0], Head: [10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-70, 0, -6], ArmL: [-70, 0, 6], ForearmR: [-8, 0, 0], ForearmL: [-8, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)),\n  hold('Plank', { Pelvis: { r: [66, 0, 0], p: [0, -0.2, 0] }, Head: [-48, 0, 0], ArmR: [-63, 0, -5], ArmL: [-63, 0, 5], HandR: [-40, 0, 0], HandL: [-40, 0, 0], FootR: [55, 0, 0], FootL: [55, 0, 0] }),\n];\n\n// Scrubbed reps: keys built with placeFeet AND a feet track, or the sole dips through the floor mid-clip.\nconst squatTop = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.02, 0] }, Torso: [2, 0, 0], ArmR: [6, 0, -9], ArmL: [6, 0, 9] };\nconst squatLow = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.3, -0.05] }, Torso: [26, 0, 0], Head: [-20, 0, 0], ArmR: [-85, 0, -8], ArmL: [-85, 0, 8] };\nconst SquatRep = { name: 'SquatRep', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, feet(squatTop, flat, flat)], [30, feet(squatLow, flat, flat)]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, { R: flat, L: flat }]] };\nconst lungeLow = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.24, 0] }, Torso: [6, 0, 0], ArmR: [10, 0, -14], ArmL: [10, 0, 14] };\nconst LungeR = { R: { z: 0.34 }, L: { z: -0.32, pitch: 25, pivot: 'ball' } };\nconst LungeRepR = { name: 'LungeRepR', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, feet(squatTop, flat, flat)], [30, feet(lungeLow, LungeR.R, LungeR.L)]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, LungeR]] };\nconst LungeL = { L: { z: 0.34 }, R: { z: -0.32, pitch: 25, pivot: 'ball' } };\nconst LungeRepL = { name: 'LungeRepL', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, feet(mirror(squatTop, HERO_RIG), flat, flat)], [30, feet(mirror(lungeLow, HERO_RIG), LungeL.R, LungeL.L)]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, LungeL]] };\nconst pressLow = feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.06, 0] }, ArmR: [-30, 0, -70], ForearmR: [-120, 0, 0], ArmL: [-30, 0, 70], ForearmL: [-120, 0, 0] }, flat, flat);\nconst pressTop = feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.01, 0] }, Head: [-10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-176, 0, -10], ForearmR: [-4, 0, 0], ArmL: [-176, 0, 10], ForearmL: [-4, 0, 0] }, flat, flat);\nconst Press = { name: 'Press', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, pressLow], [30, pressTop]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, { R: flat, L: flat }]] };\n\n// Step Class: one foot up on the platform and back.\nconst stepUp = (side) => {\n  const up = { y: 0.2, z: 0.3 }, rest = flat;\n  const a = side === 'R' ? feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [4, 0, -3], ArmL: [-40, 0, 12], ArmR: [18, 0, -12] }, up, rest) : feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [4, 0, 3], ArmR: [-40, 0, -12], ArmL: [18, 0, 12] }, rest, up);\n  const mid = side === 'R' ? feet({ ...standBase, ArmL: [-20, 0, 12] }, { y: 0.12, z: 0.16, pitch: 10 }, rest) : feet({ ...standBase, ArmR: [-20, 0, -12] }, rest, { y: 0.12, z: 0.16, pitch: 10 });\n  return { name: `Step${side}`, frames: 12, keys: [[0, stand], [4, mid], [8, a], [12, a]] };\n};\n\n// Comedy and class business.\nconst once = (name, frames, keys, extra = {}) => ({ name, frames, keys, ...extra });\nconst Clips = [\n  ...POSES, SquatRep, LungeRepR, LungeRepL, Press, stepUp('L'), stepUp('R'),\n  once('HeaderNod', 10, [[0, stand], [3, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.04, 0] }, Torso: [-12, 0, 0], Head: [-22, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [6, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.06, 0] }, Torso: [18, 0, 0], Head: [28, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [10, stand]], { fast: true }),\n  { name: 'Flail', frames: 16, loop: true, keys: [[0, { ...stand, Torso: [0, 0, -14], ArmR: [-150, 0, -70], ArmL: [-20, 0, 90], Head: [0, 0, 8] }], [8, { ...stand, Torso: [0, 0, 14], ArmR: [-20, 0, -90], ArmL: [-150, 0, 70], Head: [0, 0, -8] }], [16, { ...stand, Torso: [0, 0, -14], ArmR: [-150, 0, -70], ArmL: [-20, 0, 90], Head: [0, 0, 8] }]] },\n  { name: 'Daze', frames: 40, loop: true, keys: [[0, { ...stand, Torso: [4, 0, -5], Head: [10, 0, -14], ArmR: [10, 0, -18], ArmL: [10, 0, 18] }], [20, { ...stand, Torso: [4, 0, 5], Head: [10, 0, 14], ArmR: [10, 0, -18], ArmL: [10, 0, 18] }], [40, { ...stand, Torso: [4, 0, -5], Head: [10, 0, -14], ArmR: [10, 0, -18], ArmL: [10, 0, 18] }]] },\n  once('Bow', 36, [[0, stand], [12, feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [48, 0, 0], Head: [16, 0, 0], ArmR: [-12, 0, -6], ArmL: [-12, 0, 6] }, flat, flat)], [24, feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [48, 0, 0], Head: [16, 0, 0], ArmR: [-12, 0, -6], ArmL: [-12, 0, 6] }, flat, flat)], [36, stand]]),\n  (() => { const open = { ...stand, ArmR: [-70, 0, -32], ForearmR: [-70, 30, 0], ArmL: [-70, 0, 32], ForearmL: [-70, -30, 0] }, shut = { ...stand, ArmR: [-70, 0, -12], ForearmR: [-85, 50, 0], ArmL: [-70, 0, 12], ForearmL: [-85, -50, 0] }; return { name: 'SlowClap', frames: 40, loop: true, keys: [[0, open], [30, open], [34, shut], [36, shut], [40, open]] }; })(),\n  once('Sneeze', 24, [[0, stand], [10, feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [-16, 0, 0], Head: [-26, 0, 0], ArmR: [-50, 0, -10], ForearmR: [-110, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [13, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.08, 0] }, Torso: [34, 0, 0], Head: [30, 0, 0], ArmR: [-50, 0, -10], ForearmR: [-110, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [24, stand]], { fast: true }),\n  once('CoachPoint', 30, [[0, stand], [8, { ...stand, ArmR: [-96, 0, -24], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }], [24, { ...stand, ArmR: [-96, 0, -24], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }], [30, stand]]),\n  hold('Tuck', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.42, -0.08] }, Torso: [46, 0, 0], Head: [-30, 0, 0], ArmR: [-40, 0, -14], ArmL: [-40, 0, 14], ForearmR: [-60, 0, 0], ForearmL: [-60, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)),\n  hold('Cannonball', { Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.2, 0] }, Torso: [38, 0, 0], Head: [10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-70, 0, -8], ForearmR: [-100, 0, 0], ArmL: [-70, 0, 8], ForearmL: [-100, 0, 0], LegR: [-115, 0, 0], ShinR: [130, 0, 0], LegL: [-115, 0, 0], ShinL: [130, 0, 0] }),\n  hold('SkyFlail', { Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.1, 0] }, Torso: [-12, 0, 0], Head: [-10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-140, 0, -40], ArmL: [-140, 0, 40], LegR: [-30, 0, 0], ShinR: [40, 0, 0], LegL: [20, 0, 0], ShinL: [60, 0, 0] }),\n  once('PaddleRaise', 20, [[0, stand], [8, { ...stand, ArmR: [-172, 0, -8], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }], [20, { ...stand, ArmR: [-172, 0, -8], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }]]),\n  once('StepOn', 24, [[0, stand], [8, feet(standBase, { y: 0.32, z: 0.28 }, flat)], [14, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.12, 0.1] } }, { y: 0.3, z: 0.3 }, { y: 0.1, z: 0.1 })], [24, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.3, 0.2] } }, { y: 0.3, z: 0.2 }, { y: 0.3, z: 0.2 })]]),\n  hold('StandOn', feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.3, 0] } }, { y: 0.3, z: 0 }, { y: 0.3, z: 0 })),\n  hold('Balance', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.04, 0] }, ArmR: [-4, 0, -86], ArmL: [-4, 0, 86], Head: [12, 0, 0] }, { z: 0.14 }, { z: -0.14 })),\n  hold('StandTall', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.01, 0] }, ArmR: [2, 0, -5], ArmL: [2, 0, 5], Head: [-2, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)),\n  (() => { const a = feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.1, 0] }, ArmR: [-20, 0, -38], ForearmR: [-50, 0, 0], ArmL: [-20, 0, 38], ForearmL: [-50, 0, 0] }, { z: 0.14 }, { z: -0.14 }); return hold('HoopStance', a); })(),\n  { name: 'PlankBreathe', frames: 60, loop: true, keys: [[0, POSES[5].keys[0][1]], [30, POSES[5].keys[0][1]], [60, POSES[5].keys[0][1]]] },\n  gaitClip(HERO_RIG, { name: 'Jog', frames: 16, speed: 3, stance: 0.42, hip: -0.04, bob: 0.03, lift: 0.1, lean: 6, sway: 2, arms: { swing: 30, elbow: 75 } }),\n];\nexport const GAME_CLIPS = Clips;\nexport const ALL_CLIPS = [...HERO_CLIPS, ...GAME_CLIPS];\nexport const CLIP_NAMES = ALL_CLIPS.map((c) => c.name);\nexport const clipIndex = Object.fromEntries(CLIP_NAMES.map((n, i) => [n, i]));\nE\ncat > tools/clipcheck.mjs <<'E'\nimport { analyzeClip, compileClips, HERO_MODEL, HERO_RIG, loadModel, validateClip } from '../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { GAME_CLIPS } from '../src/art/clips.js';\nconst m = await loadModel(HERO_MODEL);\nconst compiled = compileClips(GAME_CLIPS, HERO_RIG, m.scene);\nGAME_CLIPS.forEach((def, i) => { const v = validateClip(def, HERO_RIG); const r = analyzeClip(m.scene, HERO_RIG, def, compiled[i]); if (v.length || r.problems.length) console.log(def.name, v, r.problems); });\nconsole.log('checked', GAME_CLIPS.length);\nE\nnode tools/clipcheck.mjs 2>&1 | tail -30","description":"Author animation clips and validate them"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3166,"cache_read_input_tokens":210019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3166},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8c1a9a6e-6f1f-4c91-a925-8ef76c3e492e","uuid":"ecf3bbd5-e546-4bf6-9972-c1efa51c8458","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:31:00.093Z","request_id":"req_011CgjPXtFse4H6QrF18TbRL","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01TZSfCyKR5p1U5HJGc7Phgj":{"command":"cat > src/art/clips.js <<'E'\n// Every clip the game authored. ClipDef data on the kit's HERO_RIG.\nimport { gaitClip, HERO_CLIPS, HERO_RIG, mirror, placeFeet } from '../../pixel-engine.js';\n\nconst hold = (name, pose) => ({ name, frames: 60, loop: true, keys: [[0, pose], [60, pose]] });\nconst feet = (pose, R, L) => placeFeet(pose, HERO_RIG, { R, L });\nconst flat = { z: 0 };\nconst standBase = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.02, 0] }, ArmR: [6, 0, -9], ArmL: [6, 0, 9] };\nconst stand = feet(standBase, flat, flat);\n\n// Poses for Holding Still.\nconst POSES = [\n  hold('Tree', { Pelvis: { p: [0.03, -0.02, 0] }, ArmR: [-172, 0, -6], ForearmR: [-14, 0, 0], ArmL: [-172, 0, 6], ForearmL: [-14, 0, 0], LegR: [-62, 0, -58], ShinR: [150, 0, 0], FootR: [30, 0, 0] }),\n  hold('Heron', { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.02, 0] }, Torso: [10, 0, 0], Head: [-14, 0, 0], ArmR: [-20, 0, -80], ArmL: [-20, 0, 80], ForearmR: [-30, 0, 0], ForearmL: [-30, 0, 0], LegR: [-85, 0, 0], ShinR: [95, 0, 0], FootR: [35, 0, 0] }),\n  hold('Warrior', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.2, 0] }, Torso: [0, 25, 0], Head: [0, 40, 0], ArmR: [0, 0, -90], ArmL: [0, 0, 90] }, { z: 0.38 }, { z: -0.38 })),\n  hold('Chair', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.28, -0.06] }, Torso: [24, 0, 0], Head: [-18, 0, 0], ArmR: [-110, 0, -8], ArmL: [-110, 0, 8] }, flat, flat)),\n  hold('Fold', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.03, -0.03] }, Torso: [88, 0, 0], Head: [10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-70, 0, -6], ArmL: [-70, 0, 6], ForearmR: [-8, 0, 0], ForearmL: [-8, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)),\n  hold('Plank', { Pelvis: { r: [66, 0, 0], p: [0, -0.2, 0] }, Head: [-48, 0, 0], ArmR: [-63, 0, -5], ArmL: [-63, 0, 5], HandR: [-40, 0, 0], HandL: [-40, 0, 0], FootR: [55, 0, 0], FootL: [55, 0, 0] }),\n];\n\n// Scrubbed reps: keys built with placeFeet AND a feet track, or the sole dips through the floor mid-clip.\nconst squatTop = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.02, 0] }, Torso: [2, 0, 0], ArmR: [6, 0, -9], ArmL: [6, 0, 9] };\nconst squatLow = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.3, -0.05] }, Torso: [26, 0, 0], Head: [-20, 0, 0], ArmR: [-85, 0, -8], ArmL: [-85, 0, 8] };\nconst SquatRep = { name: 'SquatRep', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, feet(squatTop, flat, flat)], [30, feet(squatLow, flat, flat)]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, { R: flat, L: flat }]] };\nconst lungeLow = { Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.24, 0] }, Torso: [6, 0, 0], ArmR: [10, 0, -14], ArmL: [10, 0, 14] };\nconst LungeR = { R: { z: 0.34 }, L: { z: -0.32, pitch: 25, pivot: 'ball' } };\nconst LungeRepR = { name: 'LungeRepR', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, feet(squatTop, flat, flat)], [30, feet(lungeLow, LungeR.R, LungeR.L)]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, LungeR]] };\nconst LungeL = { L: { z: 0.34 }, R: { z: -0.32, pitch: 25, pivot: 'ball' } };\nconst LungeRepL = { name: 'LungeRepL', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, feet(mirror(squatTop, HERO_RIG), flat, flat)], [30, feet(mirror(lungeLow, HERO_RIG), LungeL.R, LungeL.L)]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, LungeL]] };\nconst pressLow = feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.06, 0] }, ArmR: [-30, 0, -70], ForearmR: [-120, 0, 0], ArmL: [-30, 0, 70], ForearmL: [-120, 0, 0] }, flat, flat);\nconst pressTop = feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.01, 0] }, Head: [-10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-176, 0, -10], ForearmR: [-4, 0, 0], ArmL: [-176, 0, 10], ForearmL: [-4, 0, 0] }, flat, flat);\nconst Press = { name: 'Press', frames: 30, grounded: true, keys: [[0, pressLow], [30, pressTop]], feet: [[0, { R: flat, L: flat }], [30, { R: flat, L: flat }]] };\n\n// Step Class: one foot up on the platform and back.\nconst stepUp = (side) => {\n  const up = { y: 0.2, z: 0.3 }, rest = flat;\n  const a = side === 'R' ? feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [4, 0, -3], ArmL: [-40, 0, 12], ArmR: [18, 0, -12] }, up, rest) : feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [4, 0, 3], ArmR: [-40, 0, -12], ArmL: [18, 0, 12] }, rest, up);\n  const mid = side === 'R' ? feet({ ...standBase, ArmL: [-20, 0, 12] }, { y: 0.12, z: 0.16, pitch: 10 }, rest) : feet({ ...standBase, ArmR: [-20, 0, -12] }, rest, { y: 0.12, z: 0.16, pitch: 10 });\n  return { name: `Step${side}`, frames: 12, keys: [[0, stand], [4, mid], [8, a], [12, a]] };\n};\n\n// Comedy and class business.\nconst once = (name, frames, keys, extra = {}) => ({ name, frames, keys, ...extra });\nconst Clips = [\n  ...POSES, SquatRep, LungeRepR, LungeRepL, Press, stepUp('L'), stepUp('R'),\n  once('HeaderNod', 10, [[0, stand], [3, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.04, 0] }, Torso: [-12, 0, 0], Head: [-22, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [6, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.06, 0] }, Torso: [18, 0, 0], Head: [28, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [10, stand]], { fast: true }),\n  { name: 'Flail', frames: 16, loop: true, keys: [[0, { ...stand, Torso: [0, 0, -14], ArmR: [-150, 0, -70], ArmL: [-20, 0, 90], Head: [0, 0, 8] }], [8, { ...stand, Torso: [0, 0, 14], ArmR: [-20, 0, -90], ArmL: [-150, 0, 70], Head: [0, 0, -8] }], [16, { ...stand, Torso: [0, 0, -14], ArmR: [-150, 0, -70], ArmL: [-20, 0, 90], Head: [0, 0, 8] }]] },\n  { name: 'Daze', frames: 40, loop: true, keys: [[0, { ...stand, Torso: [4, 0, -5], Head: [10, 0, -14], ArmR: [10, 0, -18], ArmL: [10, 0, 18] }], [20, { ...stand, Torso: [4, 0, 5], Head: [10, 0, 14], ArmR: [10, 0, -18], ArmL: [10, 0, 18] }], [40, { ...stand, Torso: [4, 0, -5], Head: [10, 0, -14], ArmR: [10, 0, -18], ArmL: [10, 0, 18] }]] },\n  once('Bow', 36, [[0, stand], [12, feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [48, 0, 0], Head: [16, 0, 0], ArmR: [-12, 0, -6], ArmL: [-12, 0, 6] }, flat, flat)], [24, feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [48, 0, 0], Head: [16, 0, 0], ArmR: [-12, 0, -6], ArmL: [-12, 0, 6] }, flat, flat)], [36, stand]]),\n  (() => { const open = { ...stand, ArmR: [-70, 0, -32], ForearmR: [-70, 30, 0], ArmL: [-70, 0, 32], ForearmL: [-70, -30, 0] }, shut = { ...stand, ArmR: [-70, 0, -12], ForearmR: [-85, 50, 0], ArmL: [-70, 0, 12], ForearmL: [-85, -50, 0] }; return { name: 'SlowClap', frames: 40, loop: true, keys: [[0, open], [30, open], [34, shut], [36, shut], [40, open]] }; })(),\n  once('Sneeze', 24, [[0, stand], [10, feet({ ...standBase, Torso: [-16, 0, 0], Head: [-26, 0, 0], ArmR: [-50, 0, -10], ForearmR: [-110, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [13, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.08, 0] }, Torso: [34, 0, 0], Head: [30, 0, 0], ArmR: [-50, 0, -10], ForearmR: [-110, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)], [24, stand]], { fast: true }),\n  once('CoachPoint', 30, [[0, stand], [8, { ...stand, ArmR: [-96, 0, -24], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }], [24, { ...stand, ArmR: [-96, 0, -24], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }], [30, stand]]),\n  hold('Tuck', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.42, -0.08] }, Torso: [46, 0, 0], Head: [-30, 0, 0], ArmR: [-40, 0, -14], ArmL: [-40, 0, 14], ForearmR: [-60, 0, 0], ForearmL: [-60, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)),\n  hold('Cannonball', { Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.2, 0] }, Torso: [38, 0, 0], Head: [10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-70, 0, -8], ForearmR: [-100, 0, 0], ArmL: [-70, 0, 8], ForearmL: [-100, 0, 0], LegR: [-115, 0, 0], ShinR: [130, 0, 0], LegL: [-115, 0, 0], ShinL: [130, 0, 0] }),\n  hold('SkyFlail', { Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.1, 0] }, Torso: [-12, 0, 0], Head: [-10, 0, 0], ArmR: [-140, 0, -40], ArmL: [-140, 0, 40], LegR: [-30, 0, 0], ShinR: [40, 0, 0], LegL: [20, 0, 0], ShinL: [60, 0, 0] }),\n  once('PaddleRaise', 20, [[0, stand], [8, { ...stand, ArmR: [-172, 0, -8], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }], [20, { ...stand, ArmR: [-172, 0, -8], ForearmR: [-6, 0, 0] }]]),\n  once('StepOn', 24, [[0, stand], [8, feet(standBase, { y: 0.32, z: 0.28 }, flat)], [14, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.12, 0.1] } }, { y: 0.3, z: 0.3 }, { y: 0.1, z: 0.1 })], [24, feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.3, 0.2] } }, { y: 0.3, z: 0.2 }, { y: 0.3, z: 0.2 })]]),\n  hold('StandOn', feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, 0.3, 0] } }, { y: 0.3, z: 0 }, { y: 0.3, z: 0 })),\n  hold('Balance', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.04, 0] }, ArmR: [-4, 0, -86], ArmL: [-4, 0, 86], Head: [12, 0, 0] }, { z: 0.14 }, { z: -0.14 })),\n  hold('StandTall', feet({ Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.01, 0] }, ArmR: [2, 0, -5], ArmL: [2, 0, 5], Head: [-2, 0, 0] }, flat, flat)),\n  (() => { const a = feet({ ...standBase, Pelvis: { p: [0, -0.1, 0] }, ArmR: [-20, 0, -38], ForearmR: [-50, 0, 0], ArmL: [-20, 0, 38], ForearmL: [-50, 0, 0] }, { z: 0.14 }, { z: -0.14 }); return hold('HoopStance', a); })(),\n  { name: 'PlankBreathe', frames: 60, loop: true, keys: [[0, POSES[5].keys[0][1]], [30, POSES[5].keys[0][1]], [60, POSES[5].keys[0][1]]] },\n  gaitClip(HERO_RIG, { name: 'Jog', frames: 16, speed: 3, stance: 0.42, hip: -0.04, bob: 0.03, lift: 0.1, lean: 6, sway: 2, arms: { swing: 30, elbow: 75 } }),\n];\nexport const GAME_CLIPS = Clips;\nexport const ALL_CLIPS = [...HERO_CLIPS, ...GAME_CLIPS];\nexport const CLIP_NAMES = ALL_CLIPS.map((c) => c.name);\nexport const clipIndex = Object.fromEntries(CLIP_NAMES.map((n, i) => [n, i]));\nE\ncat > tools/clipcheck.mjs <<'E'\nimport { analyzeClip, compileClips, HERO_MODEL, HERO_RIG, loadModel, validateClip } from '../pixel-engine.js';\nimport { GAME_CLIPS } from '../src/art/clips.js';\nconst m = await loadModel(HERO_MODEL);\nconst compiled = compileClips(GAME_CLIPS, HERO_RIG, m.scene);\nGAME_CLIPS.forEach((def, i) => { const v = validateClip(def, HERO_RIG); const r = analyzeClip(m.scene, HERO_RIG, def, compiled[i]); if (v.length || r.problems.length) console.log(def.name, v, r.problems); });\nconsole.log('checked', GAME_CLIPS.length);\nE\nnode tools/clipcheck.mjs 2>&1 | tail -30","description":"Author animation clips and validate them"}}}
